---
layout: base.njk
title: Contact
permalink: /contact/
description: "Questions about coaching? Email, call or WhatsApp Gautam at Pondi Express."
---
<section><div class="wrap">
  <div class="head">
    <p class="eyebrow">Work with me</p>
    <h1>Get in touch</h1>
    <p class="lede">If you have any questions or comments, email me or call. If you'd rather talk it through, book a free 30-minute call.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="contact-grid">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">Email</p><a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></div>
    <div><p class="eyebrow">Phone and WhatsApp</p><a href="tel:{{ site.phone | replace(' ', '') }}">{{ site.phone }}</a><a href="{{ site.whatsapp }}" rel="noopener">Message on WhatsApp</a></div>
    <div><p class="eyebrow">Intro call</p><a href="/sign-up/#call">Book a free 30-minute call</a></div>
  </div>
  <div class="address"><p class="eyebrow">Address</p><address>Pondi Express<br>{{ site.address | replace(", Hyderabad", "<br>Hyderabad") | safe }}</address></div>
</div></section>
